description = "rust-dos, an x86 PC emulator with a DOS of its own: 386 to Pentium MMX, CGA to SVGA, the Tseng ET4000 and the S3 Trio64, a 3dfx Voodoo, Sound Blaster, Gravis Ultrasound, AdLib and General MIDI. Runs DOS programs and games from folders, zip archives, disk and CD images, and boots systems such as Windows 95."
